  "StockRole": "Juggernaut",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Black Mamba OmniMech is produced at three known facilities: on Strana Mechty by the Star Adders, on Huntress by the Cloud Cobras, and a rumored factory in the Deep Periphery near the invasion corridor. This OmniMech combines durability with agility, able to absorb significant damage while delivering powerful counterattacks. Despite its size, it remains remarkably nimble on the battlefield, making it a versatile and formidable asset in combat.",
